From: incari-client <335801235+incari-client@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:55:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] modules: Let modules hear of a saved screenshot

The screenshot event (ADR 0054): once F2's picture is written, modules hear of it on the game thread (Screenshot Manager copies it).

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/Screenshot.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/Screenshot.java
index c392cb42b2d90a67475973ebb9bf42445d4a45fc..28bef63397b1b6e82e5e37b74548c392cbdcaf95 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/Screenshot.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/Screenshot.java
@@ -57,2 +57,5 @@
                                 image.writeToFile(file);
+                                // Incari start: modules hear of it (Screenshot Manager)
+                                incari.client.modules.ModuleScreenshots.saved(file);
+                                // Incari end
                                 Component component = Component.literal(file.getName())
